    "updated_at": "2016-01-15T10:14:53Z",
    "body": "It should not. And I don't think it needs to be clarified.\n\nSynthetic events causing actions is a bug and can hopefully be fixed by browsers: https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=12230.\n",
