    "created_at": "2016-03-18T18:36:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-18T18:36:39Z",
    "body": "Right, I thought there were some cases outlined in the spec (eg. checkboxes) but perhaps most cases required for compat are unknown / unlisted.  So to figure out the real answer we'd have to disable it globally and add it back on a case-by-case basis for known issues / as breakage arises.  That's a lot of work and (more importantly) potential pain inflicted on web developers / users.  My gut instinct is that our time is better spent making sure that `click` is really the only special case here (I know we still have at least one outstanding non-click issue blocked by a new platform API).\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
