    "body": "Since we are still respond to untrusted 'click', I open a Chromium bug for the case that `display: none` details isn't toggle by a click event. We're consider whether this will be a compact issue if Firefox do toggle the `display:none` details in [bug 12452424](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1245424#c7).  Please give some feedback. @RByers @dtapuska @tabatkins \n https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=596773\n",
